  "markdown_report": "## Traceability Analysis Report\n\n**Scenario**: S2 + S3\n**Verdict**: Initial access only (confidence 0.75, ceiling 0.75)\n\n### Attack narrative\n\n攻击者 203.0.113.88 于 2026-06-23T11:04:58 命中 10.0.1.5；在 10.0.1.5 上发现 2 条执行/下载行为；matrix 关联覆盖 4/11 条 join。\n\n### Initial entry (first breach point)\n\n- **Host**: 10.0.1.5\n- **Time**: 2026-06-23T11:04:58+08:00\n- **URL**: http://10.0.1.5/upload/1.php\n- **Vector**: webshell\n- **Entry role**: observed_control_point\n- **Compromise point status**: unresolved\n- **First observed control URL**: http://10.0.1.5/upload/1.php\n- **Attacker IP**: 203.0.113.88\n- **Primary evidence**: web-201\n- **Supporting evidence**: waf-201\n\n### Attack path graph\n\n```mermaid\ngraph LR\n  n_10_0_1_5[\"10.0.1.5<br/>risk: 侦察扫描\"]\n  attacker[\"203.0.113.88\"]\n  attacker -->|first POST /upload/1.php| n_10_0_1_5\n```\n\n### Attack timeline\n\n> The attack timeline is a wide Markdown table; detailed URLs/commands remain in JSON timeline[].raw_behavior and can be reviewed by evidence ID.\n> Source columns: ✓ = evidence present in that source; ✗ = not visible.\n| Time | Stage | Host | Description | ATT&CK | Evidence | WAF | Gateway | Host Exec | Host Connect | File Op | SSH Auth | Inventory |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| 2026-06-23T11:04:58+08:00 | web_attack | 10.0.1.5 | WEB请求 POST /upload/1.php status=200 | T1190 | web-201 | ✗ | ✓ | ✗ | ✗ | ✗ | ✗ | ✗ |\n| 2026-06-23T11:04:58+08:00 | initial_access | 10.0.1.5 | 初始入口命中 /upload/1.php（webshell） | T1190 | web-201, waf-201 | ✓ | ✓ | ✗ | ✗ | ✗ | ✗ | ✗ |\n| 2026-06-23T11:05:00+08:00 | web_attack | 10.0.1.5 | WEB请求 /upload/1.php?cmd=id action=block rule=942100 | T1190 | waf-201 | ✓ | ✗ | ✗ | ✗ | ✗ | ✗ | ✗ |\n| 2026-06-23T11:07:00+08:00 | execution | 10.0.1.5 | 身份与系统侦察 | T1059 | exec-201, file-201, exec-202 | ✗ | ✗ | ✓ | ✗ | ✓ | ✗ | ✗ |\n| 2026-06-23T11:08:28+08:00 | execution | 10.0.1.5 | 身份与系统侦察 | T1059 | exec-201, connect-201, exec-202 | ✗ | ✗ | ✓ | ✓ | ✗ | ✗ | ✗ |\n### MITRE ATT&CK\n- **Techniques**: T1190 (Exploit Public-Facing Application); T1059; T1505.003 (Web Shell); T1059.004 (Unix Shell)\n- **Tactics**: TA0001, TA0003, TA0002\n\n### Lateral movement\n\n- _(none)_\n\n### Impact scope\n\n| Host | Role | Priority | Notes |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| 10.0.1.5 | initial_compromise | P0 |  |\n\n### Recommended actions\n\n1. 立即隔离初始受害主机: 10.0.1.5\n2. 保全 WEB 与 SSH 相关日志，冻结当前时间窗证据\n3. 重置横向涉及主机上的可疑账号密码，检查 SSH 密钥\n\n### Data gap impact\n\n- ssh_auth 覆盖不全，无法确认横向\n- no_match:victim_host_to_waf_by_target_ip (已知受害 host_ip（params.target_ip），反查 WAF 告警（upstream_addr→target_ip）并还原攻击源 src_ip)\n- no_match:victim_host_to_web_access_by_target_ip (已知受害 host_ip，反查网关 access（upstream_addr→target_ip）并关联 web_access_to_host_exec)\n- no_match:web_access_to_host_exec (WEB 请求落到主机命令执行（攻击是否成功）)\n- no_match:host_connect_to_dns (外连 IP 解析对应域名（C2/下载站）)\n- no_match:attacker_ip_to_ssh_auth (外网攻击 IP 是否尝试/成功 SSH 登录)\n- no_match:ssh_auth_to_host_exec_same_host (SSH 登录成功后主机上的命令执行)\n- no_match:host_to_cmdb (主机行为映射到资产清单（区域、负责人、服务）)\n- not_evaluated:host_connect_to_dns (missing asset_type: dns_log)\n\n### Open questions / hypotheses\n\n- 关联缺口：no_match:victim_host_to_waf_by_target_ip (已知受害 host_ip（params.target_ip），反查 WAF 告警（upstream_addr→target_ip）并还原攻击源 src_ip) (confidence 0.45)\n- 关联缺口：no_match:victim_host_to_web_access_by_target_ip (已知受害 host_ip，反查网关 access（upstream_addr→target_ip）并关联 web_access_to_host_exec) (confidence 0.45)\n- 关联缺口：no_match:web_access_to_host_exec (WEB 请求落到主机命令执行（攻击是否成功）) (confidence 0.45)\n- 关联缺口：no_match:host_connect_to_dns (外连 IP 解析对应域名（C2/下载站）) (confidence 0.45)\n- 关联缺口：no_match:attacker_ip_to_ssh_auth (外网攻击 IP 是否尝试/成功 SSH 登录) (confidence 0.45)\n- 关联缺口：no_match:ssh_auth_to_host_exec_same_host (SSH 登录成功后主机上的命令执行) (confidence 0.45)\n- 关联缺口：no_match:host_to_cmdb (主机行为映射到资产清单（区域、负责人、服务）) (confidence 0.45)\n\n### Evidence fetch\n\n## 数据取数统计\n\n- **实际证据 / Evidence readiness**: `evidence_observed`；资产注册评分